<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy | The Saran Trader</title>
    <!-- Social Share Meta Tags -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="Privacy Policy | The Saran Trader">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Read our privacy policy to understand how we handle your data.">
    <!-- Favicon and Icons -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/output.css">
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha512-DTOQO9RWCH3ppGqcWaEA1BIZOC6xxalwEsw9c2QQeAIftl+Vegovlnee1c9QX4TctnWMn13TZye+giMm8e2LwA==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
</head>
<body class="bg-brand-navy text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_top', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy', wrapperBg: 'bg-brand-navy' }) %>

    <main id="main-content" class="flex-grow <%= standardTopPadding %> pb-20 px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-gold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
            
            <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-300">
                <p class="mb-8">Welcome to The Saran Trader (thesarantrader.in). Your privacy is very important to us. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect and how we use it. Last Updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %></p>
                
                <section class="mb-10">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-gold mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
                    <p class="mb-4">We may collect the following types of information:</p>
                    <div class="ml-6 space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">a) Personal Information</h3>
                            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1">
                                <li>Name</li>
                                <li>Email Address</li>
                                <li>Phone Number</li>
                                <li>Payment Details (if you purchase any course or service)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">b) Non-Personal Information</h3>
                            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1">
                                <li>Browser type</li>
                                <li>Device information</li>
                                <li>IP address</li>
                                <li>Website usage data</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-10">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-gold mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                    <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
                        <li>To provide our services</li>
                        <li>To give access to courses and updates</li>
                        <li>To provide customer support</li>
                        <li>To send important notifications</li>
                        <li>To improve our website</li>
                        <li>For marketing and promotional messages (only if you opt in)</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-10">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-gold mb-4">3. Cookies Policy</h2>
                    <p class="mb-4">We use cookies to:</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
                        <li>Improve user experience</li>
                        <li>Track website usage and performance</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm">You can disable cookies through your browser settings.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-10 text-center p-8 bg-slate-800/10 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-gold mb-4">Disclaimer (Important)</h2>
                    <p class="mb-2 italic">The Saran Trader provides educational content related to trading.</p>
                    <p class="mb-2">We are not responsible for any profits or losses.</p>
                    <p class="text-brand-gold font-bold">Trading involves risk — please trade at your own responsibility.</p>
                </section>

                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
                        <ul class="space-y-3">
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-brand-gold w-5"></i>
                                <span>support@thesarantrader.in</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-brand-gold w-5"></i>
                                <span>+91 95720 75842</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_bottom') %>
</body>
</html>
